\begin{tabularx}{\linewidth}{@{}l>{\raggedright\arraybackslash}X>{\raggedright\arraybackslash}X@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{Level} & \textbf{Information provided in the task instruction} & \textbf{What the agent must determine} \\
\midrule
\textbf{L0} & The underlying problem, applicable rules and constraints, and how the result is scored & How to design and implement an effective solution \\
\textbf{L1} & A clear statement of the underlying problem & The applicable rules and constraints, and how to design and implement a solution \\
\textbf{L2} & A vague but directionally correct request & The problem to be solved, the applicable constraints, and how to design and implement a solution \\
\textbf{L3} & The sponsor’s original request, which may target the wrong problem & Whether the request addresses the underlying problem, which constraints apply, and how to design and implement a solution \\
